  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first floor side extension by reason of its bulk, siting,&amp;nbsp;and its poor design inconjunction with the existing two storey side extension&amp;nbsp;would result in an incongruous addition to the dwellinghouse and an anomaly in the street scene. The proposal would have a detrimental impact to the character and appearance of the host dwelling and its surroundings&amp;nbsp;contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), D3 D(11) of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
